# Journeys agent contract (pointer)

Do not treat this file as the rule set.

1. Read `AGENTS.md` (session contract and reading order).
2. Follow `.cursor/rules/*.mdc` (always-on and path-scoped policy).
3. Load `docs/product/` then `docs/platform/` for the task.

The former onion/API/Core/DAL rules live in those `.mdc` files so they activate by path.
